SearchMsg 2.0
-------------

This Type X door is the first in the upcoming msgbase mods for AmiExpress.
Please note, that this is only compatible with the 2.34 version of express.

This door/mod will allow your users to search the message base for key
text, this includes the body of the text as well.
 
This is another in the LOOK-RITE series.
 
Installation:
 
   1> Please append the following to you BBS.Cmd file.
 
      -----cut here-----
RS        XM001DOORS:SearchMsg
      -----cut here-----
 
   2> then place the file SearchMsg into your DOORS: directory.

Written by Joseph Hodge
 
-------------
